<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S DOUBLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's doubles results at Wimbledon on Thursday:</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>6-Nicole Arendt (U.S.)/Manon Bollegraf (Netherlands) beat 11-Naoko Kijimuta (Japan)/Nana Miyagi (Japan) 6-2 3-6 6-1</p>
</text>
